{"ID":"20240205153647-m704gh9","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153647-m704gh9","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153647-m704gh9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206092455-sawul4q\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240612170307-oqahiod\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:3800,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240628082957-xf94s09\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:8,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:8\u0026#125;","title":"268虎掌（天南星）","type":"doc","updated":"20240822105625"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206092455-sawul4q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206092455-sawul4q","updated":"20240206092500"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产安徽、江苏、河南、河北等地。\n【性状】\t本品呈扁球形，高 12cm，直径1.56.5cm 。表面类白色或淡棕色，较光滑，顶端有凹陷的茎痕，周围有麻点状根痕，有的块茎周边有小扁球状侧芽。质坚硬，不易破碎，断面不平坦，白色，粉性。气微辛，味麻辣。\n【品质】\t以个大，粉性足、色白者为佳。\n【性味】\t苦、辛，温，有毒。\n【功效】\t燥湿化痰，祛风定惊，消肿散结。主治中风半身不遂、癫痫、惊风、破伤风、跌打损伤、或虫蚁咬伤等病症。\n【炙品】\t姜南星 (制天南星) ：取净天南星，按大小分别用水浸泡，每日换水 23 次，如起白沫时，换水后加白矾 (每 100kg天南星，加白矾 2kg)，泡一日后，再进行换水，至切开口尝微有麻舌感时取出天南星，用生姜、白矾各12.5kg。 炮制后降低南星毒性。胆南星：取制南星细粉，加入净胆汁 (或胆膏粉及适量清水) 拌匀，蒸60分钟至透，取出放凉，制成小块，干燥。或取生南星粉，加入净胆汁 (或胆膏粉及适量清水) 拌匀，放温暖处，发酵715天后，再连续蒸或隔水炖9昼夜，每隔2小时搅拌1次，除去腥臭气，至呈黑色浸膏状，口尝无麻味为度，取出，晾干。再蒸软，趁热制成小块，干燥。制南星细粉每100公斤，用牛 (或猪、羊) 胆汁400公斤 (或胆膏粉40公斤) 。可清热化痰，息风定惊。用于痰热咳嗽，咯痰黄稠，中风痰迷，癫狂惊痫。\n【注解】\t“棕眼”：指药材在其凹陷的茎基痕周围的很多麻点状须根痕。\n“疙瘩”：指天南星药材表面上突起的侧芽。"}]},{"ID":"20240206092454-igv0e8o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206092454-igv0e8o","updated":"20240206092454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206092454-a46gzk9.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205163957-q1u49s6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205163957-q1u49s6","updated":"20240205163957"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"天南星"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/天南星-20240205163957-ppskz5f.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205163957-z29wz8c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205163957-z29wz8c","updated":"20240205163957"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"天南星2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/天南星2-20240205163957-kqvwbko.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240822105041-2qcvbry","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240822105041-2qcvbry","updated":"20240822105122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 370px;","style":"width: 360px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"天南星"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/天南星-20240822105041-1mexkpe.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 360px;\" parent-style=\"width: 370px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 371px;","style":"width: 361px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"天南星 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/天南星 1-20240822105115-94vju3q.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 361px;\" par